# Allowlist: the context holds only what the Dockerfile copies (tests feed the `test` target only).
# Everything else (.env*, README, scripts/, caches, editor files) never reaches the daemon.
*
!requirements.txt
!requirements-semantic.txt
!requirements-dev.txt
!src/
!tests/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.DS_Store
